 own death  it's kind of something to think about  Captain America saves the world by  sacrificing himself but still gets to  live on it hasn't been confirmed yet but  the fan hood mostly believes two things  that Captain America will die and to  that time travel will be involved  somewhat following this storyline from  the comics will really make fans happy I  think again Marvel is making Thanos out  to be the biggest baddest ruthless  villain that we've ever seen on screen  and Chris Evans has not renewed his  contract to play Captain America so  obviously it seems like he is going to  die but maybe this way the fans will  actually be ok with it and it would set  him up to go out as a true hero  sacrificing his life for the greater  good he was saved the world possibly the  universe he would save all of his  friends and then he would get a huge big  memorial so everybody could remember him  but this would also make it to where he  would still be alive in some time now  time travel is tricky there are many  things to consider such as like the  butterfly effect where if you affect one  thing in the past the whole entire  feature can be changed and I think if  that's how it would be in the movie then  that would be the ultimate goal to go  back in time to defeat Thanos in the  past that way if anybody has died in the  future they should be brought back to  life when they return to the future  again time travel is very complicated  subject to talk about and ultimately the  rooster brothers could do whatever the  heck they want to with the films but  here's a theory that I think could  possibly play out in Avengers infinity  war or Avengers 4 at the end of Captain  America Civil War there was obviously a  huge tear left in the relationship  between Captain America and Iron Man  it's been stated that this tension and  tear will continue throughout Avengers  infinity war they ultimately both love  each other and I think that Captain  America is going to sacrifice himself to  save Iron Man at some point during  Avengers infinity war most likely at the  end I think Danos will collect all of  the Infinity stones and wipe out half of  the universe and then the Avengers will  have to figure out some way to go back  in time to save everybody from here I  think a few Avengers will go back in  time including Iron Man The Hulk and  ant-man they'll then team up with the  current Avengers in the time that they  go to and they'll explain everything  that has happened in the future  including telling Captain America that  he dies from here they'll somehow figure  out a way to defeat Thanos and when the  Avengers go back to the present time  Captain America and all that he'll have  died will be back earth should be at  peace at that moment and Captain America  now knowing about time travel will be  sent  back in time to live with Peggy Carter  this would be satisfying on a few  different levels we could see Captain  America sacrifices own life to save his  best buddy Iron Man but still be in  Avengers 4 thanks to the time travel  he'd then be brought back at the end of  Avengers 4 which would satisfy everyone  who loves Captain America he would then  get his happily ever after by going back  in time and spending the remainder of  his years with Peggy Carter this would  then leave the mantle of Captain America  open for somebody to take such as Falcon  this would then start the new generation  of Avengers so this is my theory on what  could possibly happen with Captain  America and Avengers infinity war based  on the comics what do you guys think of  this theory possibly playing out and do  you have any theories of your own let me  know in the comments below I'd love to  hear from you be sure to give this video  a like and please be sure to subscribe  to my channel to stay up to date on  Avengers infinity war and join The Wolf  Gang thank you so much for watching  Wolf Wolf  [Music]

